'''Skelecat''' (ネコボーン Neko Bōn, '''Bone Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Skelecat
|image = E 136.png
|first appearance = [[Shambling Along (Expert)]]
|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 27|Infernal Tower - Floor 27]]
|money drop = 250¢ - 987¢
}}

==Enemy==
Skelecat is extremely frail for an awakened enemy. However, similar to [[Gato Amigo (Enemy)|Gato Amigo]], they deal high damage and appear in swarms.

==Strategy==
Due to his not-so-high health and somewhat slow attack speed, using few meatshields and a stack of [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] or a big hitter is usually enough to dispose of him; for more detailed strategies, check the pages of the levels he appears in.

